  "description": "Strength • Build • Performance • Geometry • Build Kits • Technical Specs\n\nThe Tetra Fat Mountain Tandem shares its origin with our other Tetra Mountain tandems. Utilizing high modulus carbon, we can create a supple ride feel that remains burly and strong enough to support a fat tire platform. Our fat bike rear end is integrated into our standard tubing style with a unique process that pushes the boundaries of what a fat bike can do.\n\nThe Tetra Fat Mountain Tandem is compatible with 26″ wheel size, rigid or suspension forks, and custom sizing to offer versatility to the rider. Fat tires enable the tandem to have a ‘float’ like feel as it rides through snow, sand, and even dirt smoother than any other Mountain tandem in our line up.\n\nOur wrapped lug design provides a level of comfort and compliance that procures an astounding ride quality that few other bikes can deliver. Through more than 30 years of research, development, and advancements in the carbon bicycle industry, we’ve perfected our unique manufacturing process to develop the perfect tailored ride for every tandem team.\n\nOur expert-selected build kits utilize your favorite components from the likes of SRAM, Shimano, Campagnolo, and more to deliver a well rounded package while eliminating the guess work related to tandem construction and specifications. Each unique build kit is thoroughly tested to ensure maximum reliability and performance. See available build kits for this model.",
